{"3821470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fear The Unknown - Jamie Story", "steam_appid": 3821470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear the unknown ,In the game, you will play as one of the lucky ones who met them and survived.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a very rare case stories like this almost never reach us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a few people were lucky enough to survive an encounter with <i>Them</i> and tell what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful forces try to hide these stories and make sure they are forgotten in the vast space around us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re doing our best to collect the pieces and put the puzzle together to see the full picture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear The Unknown : Jamie Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jamie, a young and successful man, is forced to leave the big city and his business to help his father solve problems on the family farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to revisiting familiar places and memories from his childhood, Jamie is faced with an unexpected encounter with &quot;Them&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can he survive such a meeting, or will it change everything? This story will reveal the answer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a first-person narrative experience, ufo horrror, blending walking simulation with elements of exploration, driving, drinking, and interactive conversations. It is a short game about UFO and aliens and is very inspired by x-files series, with approximately 45 minutes of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Control</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASDW - Movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[LMB] - Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[RMB] - Task help</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[F] - Flashlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support GamePad</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear the unknown ,In the game, you will play as one of the lucky ones who met them and survived.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a very rare case stories like this almost never reach us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a few people were lucky enough to survive an encounter with <i>Them</i> and tell what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful forces try to hide these stories and make sure they are forgotten in the vast space around us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re doing our best to collect the pieces and put the puzzle together to see the full picture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear The Unknown : Jamie Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jamie, a young and successful man, is forced to leave the big city and his business to help his father solve problems on the family farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to revisiting familiar places and memories from his childhood, Jamie is faced with an unexpected encounter with &quot;Them&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can he survive such a meeting, or will it change everything? This story will reveal the answer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a first-person narrative experience, ufo horrror, blending walking simulation with elements of exploration, driving, drinking, and interactive conversations. It is a short game about UFO and aliens and is very inspired by x-files series, with approximately 45 minutes of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Control</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASDW - Movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[LMB] - Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[RMB] - Task help</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[F] - Flashlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph